# Backend Standards (lazy-loaded)

Full standards: `.hive/standards/backend.mdc`

## Quick reference — layer rules

```
domain/         → entities, value objects, repository interfaces. NO Prisma, NO Express.
application/    → use cases, services (orchestrate only, no business logic).
infrastructure/ → Prisma queries, external API clients. Implements domain interfaces.
presentation/   → thin controllers. Parse HTTP, call service, format response. NO logic.
```

## Critical rules

- Monetary fields: `Decimal` (`@db.Decimal(15,4)`) — never `Float`
- Time fields: `Int` minutes — never `Float` hours
- Repository interface lives in `domain/`, implementation in `infrastructure/`
- Services never import Prisma directly
- Controllers never contain business logic
